"如果勾选，卸载插件将永久删除所有语言分配、翻译关系、元描述、每页预设、AI词汇表和每个帖子的翻译记忆。这无法撤销。除非你完全移除网站的多语言支持，否则请不要勾选。"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:85
msgid ""
"If you have a general SEO plugin installed, this panel shows how LF adapts "
"to avoid duplicate output. The goal is collision avoidance — not cooperation."
" LF always provides the multilingual SEO layer (hreflang, og:locale, "
"inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF's language routing "
"configuration to produce correctly."
msgstr ""
"如果你安装了通用SEO插件，此面板显示LF如何适应以避免重复输出。目标是避免冲突——而非合作。LF始终提供多语言SEO层（hreflang、og:"
"locale、inLanguage schema），这需要了解LF的语言路由配置以正确生成。"

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:126
msgid ""
"If you have Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress installed, "
"Lingua Forge detects them and adapts to avoid duplicate output. For hreflang,"
" LF takes over entirely and suppresses the plugin's output because those "
"plugins cannot produce correct hreflang for a multilingual routing "
"configuration. For Open Graph, LF adds only og:locale and og:locale:"
"alternate — the multilingual signals the plugin cannot provide — and leaves "
"the base OG set to the plugin. For Schema.org, LF disables its own output "
"entirely to avoid conflicting JSON-LD graphs."
msgstr ""
"如果你安装了Yoast SEO、Rank Math、All in One SEO或SEOPress，Lingua "
"Forge会检测到它们并调整以避免重复输出。对于hreflang，LF完全接管并抑制插件的输出，因为这些插件无法为多语言路由配置生成正确的hreflang。对于Open"
" Graph，LF只添加og:locale和og:locale:"
"alternate——多语言信号，这是插件无法提供的——并将基础OG集留给插件。对于Schema.org，LF完全禁用自己的输出以避免冲突的JSON-"
"LD图表。"

